### 1. hent alle kontrakter
GET {{host}}/api/Contract
Accept: application/json

### 2. opret en kontrakt
### POST - Opret Contract
POST http://localhost:5108/api/Contract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-12-15"
}

### 3. GET id
GET {{host}}/api/Contract/{{contracId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/Contract/{{contracId}}

